# Image visual lock (do not regress)

Polymer screenshots (EVA astronaut, job-firing “Termination”, handshake “Initiation”, typeset titles on photos) happened because prompts used the **short tab label only**. Do not go back to that. `npm test` must stay green (`src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.test.ts`, `src/lib/contentImageJobs.test.ts`).

## Invariants (code, not prompts)

- **Grounded subject:** every AI image goes through `buildGroundedVisualPrompt` in [`src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.ts`](src/lib/imageVisualPrompt.ts). Pass course title, module title, slide title, panel label, **panel body**, and `mediaPrompt`. Never prompt with the label alone (`EVA`, `Termination`, `Initiation`, `Monomer`).
- **Homonyms:** resolve technical meaning in this course’s domain. EVA = ethylene-vinyl acetate resin, not an astronaut. Termination = radical chain ending, not a firing. Initiation = free-radical attack, not a handshake.
- **No text in the picture:** `IMAGE_NO_TEXT_RULE` / `withImageNoTextRule` on every `/api/generate-image` call. Blank packaging, bottles, screens, signs. The player already shows titles.
- **Vision QA:** [`server.js`](server.js) `POST /api/generate-image` reviews the result (`hasVisibleText` / `offTopic`) and retries once. Client sends `intended` from the grounded builder. Skip review on failure; do not drop the first image.
- **Generic mediaPrompt** like `Professional illustration related to …` is ignored; use panel body instead.

## Click & Reveal canvas

Intro / prompt on the **left**; reveal rows on the **right**, not a full-width stack. [`src/components/interactions/ClickRevealInteraction.tsx`](src/components/interactions/ClickRevealInteraction.tsx). Do not restore stacked full-width fields that leave empty space after reveal.

## Authoring AI images (do not regress)

- **In-flow by default.** Generated tab/content images stay `imageUrl` / `introImageUrl` in the column. Do **not** auto-promote with `fi-ai-` / `fi-promo-` (overlays tab titles). `stripCourseAutoPromotedFloating` stays.
- **Crop / move / resize like uploads:** authoring chrome on [`EnlargeableImage`](src/components/player/EnlargeableImage.tsx) (Crop + Move) lifts into [`FloatingImageCanvas`](src/components/FloatingImageCanvas.tsx) with id `fi-${Date.now()}`. Uploads still go straight to the float canvas.
- **Edit → Generate AI images** fills remaining empty slots only (`collectContentImageJobs`, cap `MAX_CONTENT_AI_IMAGES` = 14). Skips quizzes/objectives and slides that already have `imageUrl` or a slide-level float.
- **Edit → Generate AI image for this slide** passes `{ slideId }` — that slide’s empty slots only. Never a course-wide refill.
- **Images only.** `applyContentImageUrl` writes `imageUrl` / `introImageUrl` / tab `imageUrl`. It must not rewrite OST, voice-over, interaction type, tab labels, or tab copy.

## How to change this

Change the helpers and add a failing test first. Prompt-only “no text / be thoughtful” instructions will drift.
